WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.480
If you take blood pressure or other heart medications, this one is important.

2
00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:08.240
If you normally take your blood pressure medication in the morning, please take

3
00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:09.840
it with a small sip of water.

4
00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:14.390
However, please confirm this with your doctor's office in advance, as

5
00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:17.520
recommendations can vary depending on your specific medication.

6
00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:21.520
Do not skip your blood pressure medication without checking with us first.

7
00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:25.030
Keeping your blood pressure stable during the procedure is important for your

8
00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:25.600
safety,

9
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:28.640
and your doctor wants to make sure you're set up well before you arrive.
